diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index ea1a1a0..7b4861f 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,20 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `v1.Files.AddReader` to allow uploading pre-built multipart bodies.
+- Add `WithFileDealID`, `WithFilePersonID`, `WithFileOrganizationID`, `WithFileProductID`, `WithFileActivityID`, `WithFileLeadID`, and `WithFileProjectID` options for associating uploaded files.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Make `v1.Files.Add` replayable so document uploads can be retried automatically on rate limits (429) and transient errors.
+- Support replay of `io.ReadSeeker` bodies (such as files opened with `os.Open`) in `RawClient.Do` and retry transport.
+
+### Changed
+
+- `v1.Files.Add` now accepts `(ctx, fileName, content, opts...)` matching `CallLogs.AddRecording`, building the multipart body automatically. Existing callers passing a pre-built multipart body and content type can switch to `Files.AddReader`.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
